2192","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"S☆猫","creatorId":"vndb:s17619","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17619","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17619","name":"S☆猫","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:152193","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c75143","characterName":"森角 初楓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66299","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"261151"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20595"],"vndbCharacterId":"c75143"},"originalCharacterName":"森角 初楓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"- A girl who has perfect wife's skills and is easy to get along with, but also a slight tendency to delusions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ichika is the same age as the protagonist, is the most reliable person in the dorm and has common sense. She's good at living on her own and great at cooking. A girl who would firmly support her future husband."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the dorm she's always in charge of tsukkomi. Also, she tends to lose herself in delusions and blush all alone in the corner of her room."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she's a mediator in the dorm, Ichika is weak when pressured by others and ends up being dragged down by others' pace."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*Charm Point: Will spoil you"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*Gap Moe: She's a closet pervert"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Study Course: Cooking - Boulanger​ (bread-baking)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on translation from developer's site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75143"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同い年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寮で一番のしっかり者、常識人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生活能力が高く料理が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"将来は旦那を支えるいいお嫁さんになりそうな女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目も落ち着きがあり、ふんわり＆少しのんびりとしたところもある癒し系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は天然ではなく、どちらかといえばツッコミタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また妄想癖があり、部屋の隅で勝手に１人でプルプル赤くなっていることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まとめ役ではあるが押しに弱く、人に流されやすいところが玉に瑕。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20595","sourceWorkId":"27256","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同い年。寮で一番のしっかり者、常識人。生活能力が高く料理が得意。将来は旦那を支えるいいお嫁さんになりそうな女の子。寮ではいつも、ツッコミ担当。また妄想癖があり、部屋の隅で勝手に１人でプルプル赤くなっていることも。まとめ役ではあるが押しに弱く、人に流されやすいところが玉に瑕。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「困ったことがあったら、いつでも私を頼ってくれていいんだからね？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66299"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba8ee0a584fb2576b6c5b86bae9679a800cf6c082d37416fd3405349aa8d6958.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10c9b798266d16da59eec883917bb36ec1b6c0d7763aa15e58dd0cb5f83190ee.webp","width":178,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松山紗香","creatorId":"vndb:s904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s904","name":"松山 紗香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:261151:66299:10662:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c75144","characterName":"楠木 晴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66300","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"261151"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20596"],"vndbCharacterId":"c75144"},"originalCharacterName":"楠木 晴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"- A girl who's bad at relying on others and loves sports."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hare is the same age as the protagonist and loves sports. She's modest and serious, although she is thought by her surroundings to be a genius who can do anything, she in actually works really hard in secret."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Normally she appears to be smiling without care in the world, but she has great intuition and can easily read the atmosphere. Also, she's sensitive to others' feelings and has become emotionally delicate as well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although Hare is unaware of it, her gestures often happen to make the protagonist's heart skip a beat."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*Charm Point: She satisfies your desire to monopolise"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*Gap Moe: Very feminine and delicate"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Study Course: Sports Instructor"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on translation from developer's site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75144"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同い年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツが大好きな快活ヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周りの人間からは何をやっても上手くいく、そんな天才肌だと思われているが実は逆。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際は謙虚で真面目な性格で、影の努力を怠らない努力家な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は脳天気に笑っていることが多いが、勘が良く場の空気をいち早く読むことが出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また他人の感情の機微に敏感であり、人一倍繊細な一面も持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔からスポーツ女子特有の健康的な色気があり、本人は無自覚で主人公をドキドキさせてしまうこともしばしば。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20596","sourceWorkId":"27256","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同い年。スポーツが大好き。謙虚で真面目、影の努力家で、周りの人間からは何をやっても上手くいく、天才肌だと思われている。普段は脳天気に笑っていることが多いが、勘が鋭く、場の空気をいち早く読める。また、他人の感情の機微に敏感で、人一倍繊細な一面がある。本人は無自覚であるが、ふいに主人公をドキドキさせる仕草をしてしまうところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ビックリ、私をちゃんと女の子として扱ってくれる人、キミが初めてかも」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66300"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e6c7078729b6a0d308737389c18fb55f1b2fb52266cf85a984ca1c5441dacc1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/049f98158c610e43a6d0b573f7285d927ae844ad791ab622359246d165f84171.webp","width":178,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"南波みみ","creatorId":"vndb:s13057","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13057","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13057","name":"南波 みみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:261151:66300:43662:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c75145","characterName":"皆見 真央","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66301","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"261151"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20597"],"vndbCharacterId":"c75145"},"originalCharacterName":"皆見 真央","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"- A naive kouhai completely in love with protagonist"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A junior one year younger than the protagonist. Mao has an energetic personality, but because of that - for better or worse, she's the dorm's mood maker."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her recklessness often causes trouble in the dorm, but thanks to her kindness she is being trusted by everyone. She loves kids and in the future wants to work with childcare."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*Charm Points: Respects you"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*Gap Moe: Sometimes shows very mature expressions"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Study Course: Childcare"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on translation from developer's site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75145"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の一つ年下の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気いっぱいで明るい性格の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし明るい反面弄られやすく、良くも悪くも寮のムードメーカー的な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"猪突猛進で寮内ではトラブルを起こすこともあるが、優しい性格のためみんなからの信頼は厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供が大好きで、将来は保育師を目指している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"交際後はとにかく甘えん坊で、主人公に分かりやすく好意を伝えてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな人の言うことはすんなり信じてしまう、弄り甲斐のあるヒロイン。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20597","sourceWorkId":"27256","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の一つ年下の後輩。元気いっぱいで明るい性格。しかし、明るい反面弄られやすく、良くも悪くも寮のムードメーカー的な存在。猪突猛進で寮内ではよくトラブルを起こすが、優しい性格のためみんなからの信頼は厚い。子供が大好きで、将来は保育師を目指している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「先輩すごいです！！完璧です！！でも下ネタはノーサンキューです！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66301"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/904f3816739b715bdd962c5262039e4ff5855709932ccfc6ad0f2750961f8f89.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/4175388dee683d21cce10d3ba4ee7d95e3705446ecb75e1423c3f082d9940639.webp","width":178,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花澤さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s947","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s947","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s947","name":"花澤 さくら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:261151:66301:17075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c75146","characterName":"冬月 かなめ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66302","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"261151"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20598"],"vndbCharacterId":"c75146"},"originalCharacterName":"冬月 かなめ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"- A very intelligent and dexterous onee-san with perfect guard who can't get honest with herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kaname is on the same year as the protagonist, but also two years older onee-san. Always acting composed and elegant is her motto, and she is being looked up to as a charismatic genius."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she has a prim and proper image to her, Kaname has a fairly frank personality. She is on the music course right now, but she hasn't found her future dream yet and is in the middle of looking for one that will match her perfectly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is very prideful and harsh-tongued, but also very caring of her juniors. Kaname has strong sense of justice that will make her help everyone who relies on her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*Charm Point: Clumsy when it comes to love"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"*Gap Moe: Loves cute things"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Study Course: Pianist"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on translation from developer's site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75146"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学年は同じだが２歳年上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に余裕を持って優雅に行動がモットー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カリスマ天才タイプでみんなの憧れの的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚で可憐な見た目をしているが、性格は割りとサバサバ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は音楽科にいるが、まだ自分の本当の夢を見つけておらず、絶賛自分探し中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プライドが高く、交際後もかたくなに素直にならない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調はきつめだが後輩思いで、頼りにされるとなんとしてでも相手を助ける正義感が強い一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また可愛いキャラクターグッズが超好きだったり、主人公の下ネタにもついて行けるお茶目さも、同じ寮に住むみんなを驚かせる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20598","sourceWorkId":"27256","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学年は同じだが２歳年上のお姉さん。常に余裕を持って優雅に行動がモットーで、カリスマ天才タイプでみんなの憧れの的。清楚で可憐なイメージだが、性格はわりとサバサバ。今は音楽科にいるが、まだ自分の本当の夢を見つけておらず、絶賛自分探し中。プライドが高く、口調はきつめだが後輩思いで、頼りにされるとなんとしてでも相手を助ける正義感がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふっ、あなたって面白い。 そんなに私に好きって言わせたいの？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66302"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/87d0f6fdefdcae527846f1c11209d38437b0fc10ad9c31dfa2895f7f384ebe86.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa618412841470be7625cae5be695fb8f77775cbac6426f22f7456ba2c5287aa.webp","width":178,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"真木碧","creatorId":"vndb:s2000","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2000","c